You are a Principal Python Software Engineer, Senior Streamlit Architect, Senior UX Engineer, and Distributed Systems Engineer.

Your task is to generate the COMPLETE production-ready source code for:

ui/app.py

Project Name:
ClawHire

Project Description:

ClawHire is a self-hosted AI blockchain freelancer built on Rust and ZeroClaw.

The backend is written in Rust.

The frontend is written in Streamlit.

The application must NOT look like a traditional web application.

Instead, it must feel exactly like a modern Linux terminal running inside a browser.

The user should feel like they are interacting with a real AI agent through a CLI.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS

Generate COMPLETE production-ready code.

Do NOT generate placeholders.

Do NOT generate TODO comments.

Do NOT generate pseudo code.

Everything must work.

Python Version

3.13+

Follow PEP8.

Use modern Python.

Use dataclasses.

Use asyncio.

Use pathlib.

Use uuid.

Use datetime.

Use streamlit.

Use loguru.

Use typing.

Use pydantic.

No business logic.

No payment verification logic.

No report generation logic.

Only application orchestration.

